\details{
Compute motion-controlled brain phenotype estimators (MoCo): estimate group-specific brain-phenotype means and their contrast using one-step estimation, optional cross-fitting and simulations inference. The method is described in Ran et al. (2026), which is the primary reference to cite when using MoCo.
}
